             - A logging goroutine batches 10,000 events before writing them to the CSV writer.\
          3. Wait for the client workload to finish.\
             - Wait for all client goroutines to return.\
             - Close the client logging channel.\
             - Flush and finalize the client CSV output safely.\
          4. Stop the server container.\
             - Stop accepting new connections.\
             - Allow active handlers to finish.\
